  message: "Shipped in PR #3688 (commit 8de2f67015). Reclassified stdio→logging for c/rust/javascript/elixir catalogs per WI-tolif template. 4 new pin tests + downstream io_boundary suite green. Scala and Haskell were no-ops (scala has no stdio entries; haskell handle-based writes remain fs_write since the handle target can't be statically disambiguated). awaits_bakeoff_validation per AGENTS.md §Bakeoff Validation Discipline — the change reduces ipc_send false positives on non-Python repos and the magnitude is a quantitative bakeoff claim to validate."  # 0f3a
